@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_SCHOOL_USER_TOKEN
@termId = REPLACE_WITH_TERM_ID
@subjectId = REPLACE_WITH_SUBJECT_ID
@scoreOnlyAssessmentId = REPLACE_WITH_SCORE_ONLY_ASSESSMENT_ID
@questionAssessmentId = REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_BASED_ASSESSMENT_ID
@studentId = REPLACE_WITH_STUDENT_ID

### List assessments - default should include both delivery modes where records exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments?termId={{termId}}&subjectId={{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List assessments - score only filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments?termId={{termId}}&subjectId={{subjectId}}&deliveryMode=score_only
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List assessments - question based filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments?termId={{termId}}&subjectId={{subjectId}}&deliveryMode=question_based
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail - score only still works
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{scoreOnlyAssessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail - question based now works and must not expose questions/answer keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{questionAssessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### General create - score-only default still works
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "termId": "{{termId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "scopeType": "classroom",
  "classroomId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLASSROOM_ID",
  "title": "Score-only quiz",
  "type": "QUIZ",
  "date": "2026-06-23",
  "weight": 10,
  "maxScore": 20
}

### General create - question-based should be rejected with expectedEndpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "termId": "{{termId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "scopeType": "classroom",
  "classroomId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLASSROOM_ID",
  "title": "Wrong route question-based quiz",
  "type": "QUIZ",
  "deliveryMode": "QUESTION_BASED",
  "date": "2026-06-23",
  "weight": 10,
  "maxScore": 20
}

### Question-based create - still the proper route
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/question-based
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "termId": "{{termId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}",
  "scopeType": "classroom",
  "classroomId": "REPLACE_WITH_CLASSROOM_ID",
  "title": "Question-based quiz",
  "type": "QUIZ",
  "date": "2026-06-23",
  "weight": 10,
  "maxScore": 20,
  "expectedTimeMinutes": 30
}

### Patch draft question-based assessment metadata - should work if draft/unlocked/writable
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{questionAssessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated question-based quiz title"
}

### Direct single grade item entry against question-based assessment - should reject
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{questionAssessmentId}}/items/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 18,
  "note": "Should be rejected for question-based assessment"
}

### Direct bulk grade item entry against question-based assessment - should reject
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{questionAssessmentId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
      "score": 18,
      "note": "Should be rejected for question-based assessment"
    }
  ]
}

### Lock approved question-based assessment - should work only when approved/unlocked/writable
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{questionAssessmentId}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete draft question-based assessment - should work only when no submissions/grade items exist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{questionAssessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
